  "menstruationFeatureAppealBody": "Uma uya esikhathini, vele urekhode; uzokwazi ukubuka uhlu lwemijikelezo yakho yangaphambilini. Usuku olulandelayo olulindelwe lokuya esikhathini luyabikezelwa ngokuzenzakalelayo, ukuze ukwazi ukuhlela kusengaphambili.",
  "calendarDiaryFeatureAppealTitle": "Qopha isimo sakho kukhalenda",
  "calendarDiaryFeatureAppealShortDescription": "Qopha isimo sakho sansuku zonke ekhalendeni",
  "calendarDiaryFeatureAppealHeadline": "Qopha isimo somzimba sakho nsuku zonke kukhalenda",
  "calendarDiaryFeatureAppealBody": "Thepha usuku kukhalenda ukuze ubhalise isimo somzimba, imizwa, nezimpawu njll. Ungazibuka ndawonye nerekhodi lokuthatha amaphilisi kanye nerekhodi lomjikelezo wokuya esikhathini, ukuze uqonde kahle umjikelezo womzimba wakho.",
  "futureScheduleFeatureAppealTitle": "Bhala phansi izinhlelo zakho zesikhathi esizayo",
  "futureScheduleFeatureAppealShortDescription": "Phatha izinhlelo zesikhathi esizayo ezifana nezikhathi zokuvakasha kudokotela.",
  "futureScheduleFeatureAppealHeadline": "Qopha izinhlelo ezizayo kukhalenda",
  "futureScheduleFeatureAppealBody": "Ncoma uhumusho walokhu kuhlelo lokusebenza lwekusasa, ezifana nezibhedlela noma uhambo. Ungakwazi ukufaka lezi zinhlelo ku-akalenda. Njengoba zihambisana nenqubo yakho yokuthatha amaphilisi, ungakwazi ukuhlela futhi ubikelele izinsuku zokugeleza kwegazi ukuze wenze izinhlelo ezifanele.",
  "healthCareIntegrationFeatureAppealTitle": "Xhuma nohlelo lwezempilo",
