  "quickRecordFeatureAppealBody": "Cindezela isaziso sesikhumbuzi isikhathi eside ukuze kuvele isenzo esithi 'Kuthathiwe', bese ungakwazi ukuqopha ukuthatha kwakho ngaphandle kokuvula uhlelo lokusebenza.",
  "creatingNewPillSheetFeatureAppealTitle": "Faka amashidi wamaphilisi ngokuzenzakalelayo",
