  "creatingNewPillSheetFeatureAppealBody": "Uma sekuqedile iqembu lamanani wamaphilisi lamanje, iqembu elisha lamanani wamaphilisi lizokwakhiwa ngokuzenzakalelayo. Akudingeki ukuthi uguqule ngesandla, futhi akukho okushodayo emlandweni wokurekhoda.",
